@startuml
title T12-WF08 — AI CRM Data Cleaning Agent (Sequence)
autonumber
actor "Authorized User / UI" as USER
participant "NestJS Data Cleaning API" as API
participant "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "n8n WF08\nData Cleaning" as N8N
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Gemini API" as AI
participant "NestJS Review Module" as REVIEW
participant "NestJS Notification Service" as NOTIFY

USER -> API: POST /api/v1/data-cleaning/scans
API -> DB: Create WorkflowRun + audit record
DB --> API: workflowRunId and scan state
API -> MQ: Publish data.cleaning.requested with workflowRunId/scope/filter (target delivery reliability to verify)
API --> USER: 202 Accepted + workflowRunId
MQ -> N8N: Deliver data.cleaning.requested event
activate N8N
N8N -> N8N: Validate eventId, workflowRunId, scope/filter and correlation
N8N -> API: GET scan/run context
API -> DB: Read WorkflowRun and stored scan request
DB --> API: Scan context
API --> N8N: Authorized scope/filter and run status
N8N -> API: Fetch bounded Lead batch
API -> DB: Read Lead records
DB --> API: Lead batch
API --> N8N: Batch + pagination metadata
N8N -> N8N: Normalize permitted fields; detect deterministic issues/duplicate candidates
N8N -> AI: Request suggestions only for ambiguous findings
AI --> N8N: Proposed correction suggestions
N8N -> N8N: Validate finding schema, field allowlist and proposed safety flags
N8N -> API: Submit cleaning findings callback (authenticated canonical API)
API -> API: Revalidate actor, allowed fields, current values and safety/approval policy
API -> DB: Persist findings and determine review requirement
alt Ambiguous, unsafe, or human approval required
  API -> REVIEW: Create/ensure one ReviewTask idempotently
  REVIEW -> DB: Persist ReviewTask and audit record
  DB --> REVIEW: Existing or new ReviewTask ID
  REVIEW --> API: ReviewTask reference
else Safe finding can remain a preview
  API -> API: Record preview-only status; do not mutate Lead
end
API --> N8N: Finding IDs/status and optional ReviewTask reference
opt ReviewTask created and notification enabled
  N8N -> API: Request reviewer notification
  API -> NOTIFY: Send in-app notification; do not create another task
  NOTIFY -> DB: Persist notification/audit status
  DB --> NOTIFY: Notification result
  NOTIFY --> API: Notification result
  API --> N8N: Notification accepted/status
end
N8N -> N8N: Build scan summary and correlation IDs
N8N -> API: Record run completion/result
API -> DB: Update WorkflowRun status/output
DB --> API: Updated run
API --> N8N: Persisted result
USER -> API: GET /api/v1/data-cleaning/scans/:workflowRunId
API -> DB: Read final scan status, findings and summary
DB --> API: Scan result
API --> USER: Final scan status and report
deactivate N8N
note over API,MQ
NestJS authorizes the scan request, creates the WorkflowRun and publishes data.cleaning.requested to n8n.data-cleaning.q. Use publisher confirmation or an outbox/recovery pattern, acknowledgements, bounded retries and DLQ. The exact scan/run context is returned through the canonical NestJS API.
end note
note over API,REVIEW
Only the NestJS Review Module creates/ensures ReviewTask. The n8n callback
cannot apply data. A separate protected backend apply operation revalidates
approval, actor permissions, scanned values and safety policy before mutation.
end note
@enduml
